i extended my learning in how they make use of the simple CSS selectors..
universal selectors:*-It select all element
Id selectors:#firstname-	Selects the element with id="firstname"
element:p-Selects all <p> elements
class:.intro-Selects all elements with class="intro"

I extended my learning also in CSS pseudo-element
What is pseudo-element all about:CSS pseudo-element is used to style specific parts of an element. Example, Style the first letter or line, of an element

